From: vittorioromeo <mail@vittorioromeo.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:26:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] qvr fork: deterministic lightmap packing; -bounceextra;
 -rtpackets (packet occlusion rays, batched lightgrid surface-light rays)

---
 include/light/light.hh        |   2 +
 include/light/trace_embree.hh |  39 ++++++++++++-
 light/light.cc                |   6 ++
 light/ltface.cc               | 102 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 light/trace_embree.cc         |   1 +
 light/write.cc                |  21 +++++--
 6 files changed, 161 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

